    <defName>RSW_TetnissCrab</defName>
    <label>tet'niss crab</label>
    <description>Tet'niss crabs were a species of large trash crab that lived on the planet Lanupa. Specialised glands on their shell would secrete a sticky substance which allowed the creature to attach pieces of scrap metal to their body for additional defense from predation. Sometimes this resulted in the creatures being mistaken for scrap and transported to other worlds for processing only for them wander off and establish new populations.</description>
